  "description": "AWS KMS integration for the Excalibur framework. Provides IKeyManagementProvider implementation backed by AWS Key Management Service with support for multi-region keys, automatic key rotation, and FIPS 140-2 compliance. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
